=== Dark Secrets
<ssub:artist_dark_secrets>
==== $diamond.stroked.small$~Heir
<diamond-heir>
You’ve inherited the antique bookshop of your late father Hiram. You
never wanted to work there, it is boring work for boring people and the
assistant of your father, Mr.~Adkinson, is creepy straight out of the
Addams Family, or Frankenstein. You never understood how he could make a
living selling occult books to students and wiccans. And indeed the
accounting numbers are bright red. Maybe you can sell the ring Lurch
gave you.

#horizontalrule

height 0.75mm

=== Advantages
<ssub:artist_advantages>
==== $diamond.stroked.small$~Body Awareness
<diamond-body-awareness>
Your body and mind are as one. Whenever you perform acrobatic or agile
feats, :

/ (15+): #block[
Choose one option.
]

/ (10–14): #block[
Choose one option, but you expose yourself to danger or incur a cost.
]

/ (\-9): #block[
Choose one option, but something goes very wrong. The GM makes a Move.
]

#horizontalrule

height 0.75mm Options:

- Escape bindings or restraints.

- Get past an obstacle (creature or object).

- Get into or make it through a space you normally wouldn’t be able to.

#horizontalrule

height 0.75mm

==== $diamond.stroked.small$~Artifact
<diamond-artifact>
Your ring actually possesses mystical powers. Its powers can be
activated through whispering forbidden words. #emph[I the honourable
\<insert name\>, pledge to repay this favour with blood or gold, when
the time has come.] Whenever you activate the object, :

/ (15+): #block[
Choose one option (the GM determines what happens).
]

/ (10–14): #block[
Choose one option (the GM determines what happens). However, the
artifact also exacts an additional price (the GM determines what is
required).
]

/ (\-9): #block[
The artifact does something unexpected, possibly dangerous. The GM makes
a Move.
]

#horizontalrule

height 0.75mm Suggested options:

- Receive a vision of what threatens you.

- Get yourself out of a bind.

#horizontalrule

height 0.75mm

==== $diamond.stroked.small$~Enhanced Awareness
<diamond-enhanced-awareness>
When you focus your senses at a location where the Illusion is weak, .
On a success, you have visions about the place and may be able to speak
to entities tied to it:

/ (15+): #block[
You can discern clear details regarding the location.
]

/ (10–14): #block[
You get some basic impressions regarding the location.
]

/ (\-9): #block[
The Illusion tears. The veil is lifted temporarily, revealing an
alternate dimension – the GM determines which one. The PC could be
sucked into it or something may cross over into our reality. The GM
makes a Move.
]

